  "body_text": "7月8日 10:00 上新\n7月7日 10:00 会员开放提前购（\n限时24小时会员特惠\n）\n从此我们固定周四是上新日，会员可提前一天即周三购买\n这周我们准备了\n一个分享包的小礼盒，里面涵盖了在售卖的5只CoE竞标豆\n一只非常细腻的肯尼亚\n这5只CoE包含：\nGuatemala CoE9 Gesha Natural\nEthiopia CoE22 Typica Natural\nBrazil CoE3 Yellow Bourbon Natural\nBrazil CoE30 Gesha Washed\nPeru CoE20 Gesha Washed\n因为是季末的最后库存，所以非常优惠哦~\n错过这村就得等一年啦\n还有，我们有自己的盒子了，摆起来也不丑，也实用\n淘口令\n9 xixi:/🗝vumDX8bVBac🔐\n肯尼亚 尼耶里 Karogoto AA\n这款肯尼亚相比之前上架的Gakuyuini有更为细腻和透亮的酸质\n淘口令\n2 xixi:/£RwIjX8btobW🗝\n公众号-文章【进入不同产区类目查阅】更多豆子信息\n产品上新优先淘宝，有赞微店延迟同步",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          7月8日 10:00 上新\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          7月7日 10:00 会员开放提前购（\n          <strong>\n           限时24小时会员特惠\n          </strong>\n          ）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n          从此我们固定周四是上新日，会员可提前一天即周三购买\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这周我们准备了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            一个分享包的小礼盒，里面涵盖了在售卖的5只CoE竞标豆\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            一只非常细腻的肯尼亚\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这5只CoE包含：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Guatemala CoE9 Gesha Natural\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia CoE22 Typica Natural\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Brazil CoE3 Yellow Bourbon Natural\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Brazil CoE30 Gesha Washed\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Peru CoE20 Gesha Washed\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          因为是季末的最后库存，所以非常优惠哦~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          错过这村就得等一年啦\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          还有，我们有自己的盒子了，摆起来也不丑，也实用\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QuqkZs4FJfmibf08ddW7XnAsK0lnRYmI68rxO4LwyKrfp2C4YsKD8305CyEyWZOEIxfUkr1sMvlGw/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:20px;vertical-align:text-bottom;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘口令\n          <strong>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<strong>\n            9 xixi:/🗝vumDX8bVBac🔐\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QuqkZs4FJfmibf08ddW7XnA6xJRXR08Vtx78EgUTJOUpZXzUd1ibVR1OEhjAGujb826mtdGQr2S2iag/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          肯尼亚 尼耶里 Karogoto AA\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款肯尼亚相比之前上架的Gakuyuini有更为细腻和透亮的酸质\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘口令\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 79, 121);\">\n<strong>\n           2 xixi:/£RwIjX8btobW🗝\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QuqkZs4FJfmibf08ddW7XnADoZqRDPATibHLoa9lhTCIdt4iaNIKcxym27LOBlwPiaqEetPQQXa3zaVA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号-文章【进入不同产区类目查阅】更多豆子信息\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          产品上新优先淘宝，有赞微店延迟同步\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n</div>",
